shipshield (1.0.0-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial production release of ShipShield.
  * Local-first background engine with Unix domain socket IPC.
  * Security scanners orchestration for Gitleaks, Trivy, and Checkov.
  * Operational CLI suite: scan, scans, status, results, cancel, doctor, engine.

 -- ShipShield Team <maintainers@shipshield.dev>  Sun, 25 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
